{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t政務司司長陳國基表示，因應宏福苑火災成立的獨立委員會，提出的120項建議，當中29項已推行，估計絕大部分會在明年完全落實。<br/>\n<br/>\n另外，行政長官已委任公務員敍用委員會，釐清公務員在事件中的責任，估計委員會會接見約100人，預料當中40至50人會被調查，預計明年一月向行政長官提交報告。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：詹可揚\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T12:04:10.800225+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T11:41:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T17:57:53.014570+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T11:57:27.043443+00:00","content_hash":"3a57675348084c334a8c3a5e87412fd663016e78aa8b6f56157e5f202031f018","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}